WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Four steps: Job, Team, Checks, Plan.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Name the building. Choose the work.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Check who is free and what they can do.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Leave anything unknown as “Not checked”.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Record your assessment.
The app does not inspect the building.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Read who is assigned and what must wait.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
See the reason and the missing robot evidence.

8
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:06.000
One person is busy.
The whiteboard job waits.

9
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:15.000
A failed room check stops
both jobs in that room.

10
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Here, G1 needs its helper’s OK.
Being free is not a confirmation.

11
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.000
The option now fits this example.
Nothing starts.

12
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Download a readable PDF
to print or share.

13
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Save new robots and test results here.
They are not used in plans.

14
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Record what happened against a planned job.

15
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Say what happened, who did it
and whether extra help was needed.

16
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:15.000
The supervisor’s acceptance
is recorded separately.

17
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Change the outcome,
and its old check is removed.

18
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Try an example, then plan your job.
The app never starts a robot.
